1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:15,000
She holds one button. The mic is open only while she holds it.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
ClearVoice writes down what it heard.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
It offers one clear sentence. Nothing is spoken yet.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
She can change it before it is said.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Speak it — the voice runs on this laptop, offline.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Audio processed this session only. Nothing saved.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
When it misses, it says so. She starts again.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Her own words make it hear her better.

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:22,000
No background listening. No saved audio.

10
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Nothing leaves the machine.
